OL,3,ATeens who died in car that entered
OL,4,Ariver named
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys and a teenage girl who
OL,7,Fdied when the car they were in ended up
OL,8,Fin the River Wear have been named by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FA black Audi A3 with four people inside
OL,12,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,13,FWearmouth Bridge, in Sunderland, and
OL,14,Fwent in the water just before 13:30 BST
OL,15,Fon Tuesday, Northumbria Police said.
OL,17,FThe three who died have been named as
OL,18,FJackson Duke, 17, Luke Etheridge and
OL,19,FZara Shaw, both 16.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
